  << /ActualText (Collaborating with the Designer\072\nCoordinated with the primary designer to understand the project\031s key functionality and purpose\056\nDiscussed which screens and animations best represent the functionality and user experience\056\nSelecting Content\072\nChose visually rich and content\055heavy screens to showcase important elements of the project\056\nCreated custom mockups to enhance the visual appeal and presentation\056\nCase Study Development\072\nUsed provided text to structure a clear and engaging story for the case study\056\nIntegrated animations to emphasize interesting or unique functionalities of the product\056\nDesigned an overall cohesive visual flow for each case study\056)
